## What you can do
With this project, you can give a llm a hand to the outside world. no complex protocols and standards, just simple thing a model actually needs to use the hand

## Chat with a local Llama server

Start a Llama server with its OpenAI-compatible API listening on port 8080, then run `chat.ts` with a TypeScript runner such as `npx tsx chat.ts`. `chat.ts` handles the terminal conversation, while `llama.ts` handles API requests and streams replies as they are generated. Conversation history is kept until you enter `/exit` or `/quit`.

The default endpoint is `http://localhost:8080/v1/chat/completions`. Set `LLAMA_URL` to override it.